**5. Error State (does not work for pornographically motivated terms)**

CSS:
```css
.search-component.error {
  border-color: #ff0000;
  box-shadow: 0.1rem 0.1rem 0.2rem rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.5);
}

.search-component.error label {
  color: #ff0000;
}

.search-component.error .search-icon {
  color: #ff0000;
}
```
JavaScript:
```javascript
searchInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
  const query = searchInput.value.trim();
  if (query.includes('explicit term')) {
    searchInput.closest('.search-component').classList.add('error');
  } else {
    searchInput.closest('.search-component').classList.remove('error');
  }
});
```
